# Named bundles — <bundle-name>|<comma-separated module names>
#
# Pure sugar over repeated `wb add` calls (ARCHITECTURE.md principle 4,
# §10) — `wb install --bundle workstation` is exactly equivalent to one
# `wb add` call per listed name, nothing more. Mirrors the three `dotfiles`
# profiles for continuity, now that modules.list (Wave C, §12 D34) has
# real entries for all four members below.
workstation|git,gpg,ssh,shell
server|git,ssh,shell
minimal|git,ssh
